k (~2023-10-26) he threw a small party at his Japanese mansion (see ## New home (2023-03-23)) for his new album — \"It was amazing, so much love from my fam and friends!\" (the 2023-10-29 update above had his album at \"almost finished\") — and shared photos of the party: a group of people sitting in a room with a projector screen (\"Take a look at the photo of the party in the mansion, it was so energizing!\"), a group of people dancing at the party, and a group of people standing on top of a stage [S28T1][S28T3][S28T5].\n- On 2023-11-02, when Dave asked what it was like when everyone was cheering him on: \"It was incredible, Dave! The room was buzzing with energy and love. It was a powerful reminder of why I'm doing this.\" [S28T4][S28T5].\n- On 2023-11-02, said creating something that people connect with and brings joy \"is what I'm all about,\" and moments like the party \"really motivate me to keep growing!\" (complements his earlier \"passion and purpose\" remark of 2023-10-25, see above) [S28T7].","text_sha256":"59112b20febd10a08c7b41e7cf4d0a4d9b21142281d6753caa2a87cca6ce2c91","timestamp":"2023-11-02T17:46:00"},{"attribution_index_sha256":"98109144a5a23da7a5b89634be2c543ea2366f2abe85f1f3f8a3df64a5e92ce2","attribution_units":[{"dia_ids":["D28:1","D28:2","D28:3","D28:4","D28:5","D28:6","D28:7","D28:8","D28:9","D28:10","D28:11","D28:12","D28:13","D28:14","D28:15","D28:16","D28:17","D28:18","D28:19","D28:20","D28:21","D28:22","D28:23","D28:24","D28:25","D28:26","D28:27","D28:28","D28:29","D28:30","D28:31","D28:32","D28:33","D28:34","D28:35","D28:36","D28:37","D28:38","D28:39","D28:40","D28:41","D28:42","D28:43"],"kind":"curated_fact","line_end":245,"line_start":245,"source_locators":["[S28T1]","[S28T2]","[S28T3]","[S28T4]","[S28T5]","[S28T6]","[S28T7]","[S28T8]","[S28T9]","[S28T10]","[S28T11]","[S28T12]","[S28T13]","[S28T14]","[S28T15]","[S28T16]","[S28T17]","[S28T18]","[S28T19]","[S28T20]","[S28T21]","[S28T22]","[S28T23]","[S28T24]","[S28T25]","[S28T26]","[S28T2